{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "181", "x": 0.8993818052860431, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03436144331759268, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Part 4", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.12393667166651151, "w": 0.07385097977459479, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Lecturer: looking at different types of conflicts that may arise between", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.14277420698693738, "w": 0.7715444143738754, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "wildlife and humans at the boundaries of protected areas such as national", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.16161166686457823, "w": 0.7715655345143593, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "parks and animal sanctuaries. I'd like to illustrate this by telling you about", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.18059744725757176, "w": 0.7713262412721789, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "some research that I've been involved in recently in the central African", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.19943490713521264, "w": 0.7717196295199279, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "country of Zambia in the area around the ChBE bird sanctuary which contains", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2182723670128535, "w": 0.7716741084404386, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "over 300 of the listed birds of Zambia. These include a number of birds of", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.23725822284863204, "w": 0.7713696093276383, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "prey such as eagles, hawks, and owls that live by hunting and killing other", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2560956827262729, "w": 0.7721398793055739, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "birds and animals. Now, most of the people living in the local communities", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.27497018501135945, "w": 0.7714565504884647, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "near to the bird sanctuary are smallcale farmers, and these birds of prey", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2938077203317853, "w": 0.7713043009320646, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "provide important social and ecological benefits to them. For example, a lot", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.31279350072477885, "w": 0.7714130799080515, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of damage can be caused to farmers crops by rodents such as rats, which", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3316309417417234, "w": 0.771551488595688, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "would consume the crops as they grow in in the fields as well as after", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.35046840161936427, "w": 0.7711304186104116, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "harvesting if they weren't hunted and killed by the birds. And the predatory", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.36945418201235786, "w": 0.7714130799080515, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "habits of these birds also protect farmers in other ways. For example, a major", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3882917173327837, "w": 0.7720451462482583, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "danger to rural workers is snakes whose bite may be dangerous or even fatal.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.40712913948903207, "w": 0.7717615622260341, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "And birds of prey have a major role in keeping their populations under", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4259666370880654, "w": 0.7714567555383723, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "control. Local people have always been aware of these benefits and for years", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.44495241748105896, "w": 0.7721986261041041, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Even before the sanctuary was opened in 1973, the birds played a key role in", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4637898773586998, "w": 0.7717396218859198, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the culture of the region. However, more recently, the sanctuary and its birds", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.48265208246982777, "w": 0.7715002261187857, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "have also become increasingly important to the community in economic", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5016379005842139, "w": 0.771500021068878, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "terms because at present, after a relatively slow start, tourism has become", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5204753604618547, "w": 0.7717494642814852, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "an important source of revenue for them. However, although these birds of", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5393128203394956, "w": 0.7713041984071108, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "prey are protected by the government. Their numbers are falling. Some", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5582986384538816, "w": 0.7767469406297473, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of these deaths are accidental. Fatalities occur when birds are light on", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5771360983315225, "w": 0.7719369824219942, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "roads to catch and eat their prey and are hit by fastmoving traffic. Drivers in", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5959735582091633, "w": 0.7716960487805529, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Zambia have to take special care at night as birds may regard the quieter", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6148110558081967, "w": 0.7713696093276383, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "roads as safe places to sleep. Accidental deaths may also occur if these", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6337967984797978, "w": 0.7714132849579591, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "birds fly close to high voltage power lines. as they may be electrocuted. This", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6526343338002236, "w": 0.7716732882408082, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "is a particular danger in the heavy rain which can occur in the region in the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6715088360853101, "w": 0.7711955219560777, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "months from December to April. And local farmers also pose a threat to", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6904946164783037, "w": 0.7713041984071108, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "these birds. As well as growing crops, smallcale farmers in the area also rear", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7093321517987295, "w": 0.7718663427288226, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "chickens. These provide food for the farmers families as well as being an", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7281696116763704, "w": 0.7714350202481658, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "important source of income. But they're also an easy target for birds of prey.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7470070715540112, "w": 0.7716527832500472, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "And so farmers may shoot these birds, which is illegal but understandable.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7659929273897897, "w": 0.7721276788360711, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Or they may poison the birds, which again is illegal and can have negative", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7848303872674306, "w": 0.7712824631169042, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "effects on the ecosystem. So how else can farmers protect their chickens", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8036678471450714, "w": 0.7712823605919503, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "from birds of prey? Some people believe that to prevent the predators from", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.822653627538065, "w": 0.7715003286437394, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "settling near the area where the chickens kept. It's best to keep this area", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8414910874157059, "w": 0.7715863470799816, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "free from vegetation. But in fact, this is counterproductive as it means the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8603532925268339, "w": 0.7713696093276383, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "chickens have no cover to hide in and they'll be easier for the birds to see.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8791907524044748, "w": 0.7714133874829129, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Another possibility would be to prevent the chickens from going outside at", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8981765327974682, "w": 0.7718853098452765, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "all and to keep them safe from predators inside a building, but this would", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.9170139926751091, "w": 0.7712607278266975, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "cost far too much to be a practical solution. Nearly all the far Farmers", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.935851527995535, "w": 0.7714565504884647, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}